        "Id": 55,
        "ActionId": 55,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Rosewater",
            "Everything that allows us to reach the stars comes from the Earth itself. Before we set foot among the cosmos, isn't preserving our homeland's treasures in our memories the best way to honor her?",
